    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>League of Tacticians is a tactical game inspired by anime-style war stories like &quot;Kingdom.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are part of a team (Hun Clan) competing in the War League, a tournament where battles are treated like a sport. Your goal is to help your team climb the league rankings by planning smart moves and completing objectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control your squad during combat. Missions have different goals, and how well you complete them affects your team\u2019s standing in the league.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Matches:</strong> Plan each move in turn-based mode, then see your strategy play out in real time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>League Progression:</strong> One season has 18 battles. Each match brings a new challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mission Goals:</strong> Complete different objectives to help your team rank higher.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill System:</strong> Earn stars by playing well and use them to unlock new skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode:</strong> Follow your team\u2019s journey through visual novel scenes.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>League of Tacticians is a tactical game inspired by anime-style war stories like &quot;Kingdom.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are part of a team (Hun Clan) competing in the War League, a tournament where battles are treated like a sport. Your goal is to help your team climb the league rankings by planning smart moves and completing objectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control your squad during combat. Missions have different goals, and how well you complete them affects your team\u2019s standing in the league.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Matches:</strong> Plan each move in turn-based mode, then see your strategy play out in real time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>League Progression:</strong> One season has 18 battles. Each match brings a new challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mission Goals:</strong> Complete different objectives to help your team rank higher.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill System:</strong> Earn stars by playing well and use them to unlock new skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode:</strong> Follow your team\u2019s journey through visual novel scenes.</p></li></ul>",
